**Verdict:** Lab wins on size and grade at every carat weight above 1ct. The savings compound with size — from $21K at 2ct to $90K at 4ct. The only rational case for natural is origin preference, resale value in the traditional diamond market, or an emotional attachment to mined provenance. These are valid reasons. They just come with a significant price premium, and you should know that going in.

